{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_3000_place", "source_sha256": "9610db573b0748e5449af4e4374b58b873ee16b94c2b80c0cae1432390c6bbf3", "ja": "ドーム球場", "zh": "巨蛋球场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_3001_p", "source_sha256": "8ecac6a16077e7cd5f0bb9e8cfb80659ed2ffffaf97786827784a02067ed7cb5", "ja": "律子、お疲れ様！　慣れないスポーツバラエティ番組の\n収録は、さすがにこたえたようだな。", "zh": "律子，辛苦了！要录不习惯的运动综艺节目，\n看来果然有点吃力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_3002_009rit", "source_sha256": "5705636c6199fc99a549fda839557c7a570a0359275da745ecb91b257a695cae", "ja": "あはは……ありがとうございます。噂には聞いてました\nけど、本当にずーっと身体を動かしてるんですね。", "zh": "啊哈哈……谢谢你。虽然早就有所耳闻，\n但是还真的要一～直活动身体呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_3003_009rit", "source_sha256": "82799002a151969df45d9eb4a20f92474561f1a67617c6f74ebcdd21955992eb", "ja": "ちょっと甘く見てたかな～。いたたたた……。\nはぁ、これは明日、確実に全身筋肉痛ね……。", "zh": "我或许有点太小看这节目了～痛痛痛痛……\n唉……这样子，明天肯定会全身肌肉酸痛了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_3004_p", "source_sha256": "cb56e552d373dd69a708dc9b29fd8fd729b512fdf5b5f4183a9ac0eee74d6161", "ja": "大丈夫！　そんなことだろうと思って、\n差し入れを用意してあるんだ。ほら……", "zh": "没事的！我早料想到这个状况，\n所以准备了东西慰劳你，拿去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_3005", "source_sha256": "fcb23ff88217b90eaa1b1a516fe9ee5ceca5e8d5644ade64c2e70d4be32d310b", "ja": "スポーツドリンク", "zh": "运动饮料", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
